<title>CANADA: Petro-Canada raises posted oil prices.</title>
<headline>Petro-Canada raises posted oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petro-Canada said on Tuesday it raised the price it would pay for some grades of crude oil by C$7.00/cubic metre or C$1.11/barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The new prices were listed as follows: Edmonton light sweet C$165.00/cubic metre, or C$26.23/barrel Cromer light sour C$157.00/cubic metre, or C$24.96/barrel Hardisty medium C$128.00/cubic metre, or C$20.35/barrel</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
